    "Two overlapping owner corrections preserve the raw row and accept one immutable revision; the stale writer receives RevisionConflict.",
    "Revocation or document deletion commits before a waiting review write, which receives PermissionDenied without an appended revision.",
    "Staff status, direct review permission, or account activation withdrawn while a cached reviewer waits prevents the review mutation.",
    "Dictionary manager role withdrawal while candidate review, candidate publication, rollback, or bundled publication waits prevents the mutation.",
    "Processor role withdrawal while parsing activation waits preserves the previous active version and run state.",
    "A review already holding batch locks completes before deletion; deletion then revokes access without a patient/batch lock-order deadlock.",
    "Concurrent review completion makes a revocation request stale; a freshly versioned revocation still succeeds.",
    "Reparse activation before review rejects the stale task; the reverse order inherits the accepted human correction and explicit source/value conflict.",
    "Independent-patient dictionary publications serialize on the shared publication guard; one active immutable release wins and the stale preview cannot publish.",
    "Publication and rollback recheck active hash inside their shared lock in both arrival orders; the stale operation cannot change the winning active pointer.",
    "Candidate source revocation or deletion blocks a waiting dictionary publication and removes source access.",
    "Existing processing duplicate delivery, same-batch terminal updates, and publication/deletion concurrency remain passing."
  ],
